{
  "sn48.39:0.1": "Linked Discourses 48.39 ",
  "sn48.39:0.2": "4. The Pleasure Faculty ",
  "sn48.39:0.3": "The Simile of the Fire Sticks ",
  "sn48.39:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are these five faculties. ",
  "sn48.39:1.2": "What five? ",
  "sn48.39:1.3": "The faculties of pleasure, pain, happiness, sadness, and equanimity. ",
  "sn48.39:1.4": "The faculty of pleasure arises dependent on a contact to be experienced as pleasant. ",
  "sn48.39:1.5": "When in a state of pleasure, you understand: ‘I’m in a state of pleasure.’ ",
  "sn48.39:1.6": "With the cessation of that contact to be experienced as pleasant, you understand that the corresponding faculty of pleasure that had arisen ceases and stops. ",
  "sn48.39:2.1": "The faculty of pain arises dependent on a contact to be experienced as painful. ",
  "sn48.39:2.2": "When in a state of pain, you understand: ‘I’m in a state of pain.’ ",
  "sn48.39:2.3": "With the cessation of that contact to be experienced as painful, you understand that the corresponding faculty of pain that had arisen ceases and stops. ",
  "sn48.39:3.1": "The faculty of happiness arises dependent on a contact to be experienced as happiness. ",
  "sn48.39:3.2": "When in a state of happiness, you understand: ‘I’m in a state of happiness.’ ",
  "sn48.39:3.3": "With the cessation of that contact to be experienced as happiness, you understand that the corresponding faculty of happiness that had arisen ceases and stops. ",
  "sn48.39:4.1": "The faculty of sadness arises depend